{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1790593993","published":"2026-10-02T04:53:57Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:53.718672644Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-27651","CVE-2026-27654","CVE-2026-27784"],"summary":"Fix of 5 CVEs","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: NULL pointer dereference in ngx_mail_auth_http_module\n     when a CRAM-MD5 or APOP authentication attempt is retried\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-27651.patch: clear s->passwd with\n       ngx_str_null() in ngx_mail_auth_http_create_request, so the stale\n       length no longer survives into the next auth attempt and terminates\n       the worker process\n     - CVE-2026-27651\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap buffer overflow in ngx_http_dav_module on COPY\n     and MOVE inside an aliased prefix location\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-27654.patch: reject a Destination URI\n       shorter than clcf->alias in ngx_http_dav_copy_move_handler, so the\n       integer underflow in ngx_http_map_uri_to_path can no longer\n       overwrite the heap or move files outside the location root\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-27654-2.patch: also require the Destination\n       URI to match the aliased location prefix, and add the corresponding\n       check to ngx_http_map_uri_to_path\n     - CVE-2026-27654\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow in ngx_http_mp4_module on 32-bit\n     platforms while validating atom entry counts\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-27784.patch: widen the entries count to\n       uint64_t in the stts, stss, ctts, stsc, stsz, stco and co64 atom\n       size checks, so a crafted mp4 file can no longer cause reads and\n       writes outside the allocated mp4 buffer\n     - CVE-2026-27784","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.2-2+deb10u5+tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790593993.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.2-2+deb10u5+tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790593993.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.2-2+deb10u5+tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790593993.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-echo","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-echo?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.2-2+deb10u5+tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790593993.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-fancyindex","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-fancyindex?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.2-2+deb10u5+tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790593993.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-geoip","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-geoip?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.2-2+deb10u5+tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-202